roblem-ai-agents-that-actually-work","children":"The Problem: AI Agents That Actually Work"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"Most AI agent frameworks suffer from two critical flaws:"}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Unbounded execution"}]," - Agents can spin out of control, making unlimited API calls or running up huge LLM bills"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Non-deterministic outcomes"}]," - The same input can produce wildly different results, making them unsuitable for production"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["AI Crew Suite solves both problems through a ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"deterministic pipeline architecture"}]," where LLMs are used only for narrative synthesis, while tool selection and execution are fully programmatic."]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-1",{"id":"core-architecture-principles","children":"Core Architecture Principles"}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-0",{"id":"1-deterministic-tool-selection","children":"1. Deterministic Tool Selection"}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"Never let an LLM choose tools. Instead, we use pattern-matching against known query types to select pre-defined tool plans."}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-0",{"children":["$","pre","code-0",{"children":["$","code",null,{"className":"language-typescript","children":"// BAD: LLM-driven tool selection\nconst tools = await llm.chooseTools(userQuery);\n\n// GOOD: Programmatic tool selection\nconst tools = selectToolsByPattern(userQuery, predefinedToolPlans);\n"}]}]}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-1",{"id":"2-citation-backed-outputs","children":"2. Citation-Backed Outputs"}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":"Every claim in an agent's output must be traceable to specific evidence. No \"trust me, I'm an AI\" allowed."}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-1",{"children":["$","pre","code-0",{"children":"$L1b"}]}],"\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]
